02:05:37,930 --> 02:05:41,850
Good and bad people are everywhere.

2094
02:05:41,930 --> 02:05:47,290
And like I said, in individual pockets, our people really go out of the way.

2095
02:05:47,370 --> 02:05:50,010
In order to help someone, in order to assist people.

2096
