2103
02:06:22,950 --> 02:06:29,970
But I'm sure there have been people who have been genuinely.

2104
02:06:30,050 --> 02:06:32,050
genuinely nice and without any reward.

2105
02:06:34,670 --> 02:06:37,150
collectively, I don't know what happens.

2106
02:06:37,500 --> 02:06:39,870
When they come under any flag, whether it is a political flag or a religious flag.

2107
02:06:39,950 --> 02:06:42,350
whether it's a political or religious flag,

2108
02:06:42,430 --> 02:06:46,670
their collective wisdom is damaged by that.

2109
02:06:46,750 --> 02:06:48,650
And societies are destroyed by collective wisdom.

2110
02:06:48,730 --> 02:06:51,650
