people have also heard, and when you hear something good,

2115
02:07:06,694 --> 02:07:09,580
you also feel like doing good or becoming good.

2116
02:07:09,660 --> 02:07:19,934
And I'm sure this would encourage and motivate thousands of listeners who are listening right now to do something for not just a fellow Pakistani or a fellow Indian,

2117
02:07:20,014 --> 02:07:23,580
but a fellow human being, and go out of their way to convene.

2118
02:07:23,660 --> 02:07:26,380
to make their lives a little more convenient.

2119
02:07:26,460 --> 02:07:33,580
They say that the only way you can measure the significance of your own life is by valuing the lives of the others.

2120
02:07:33,660 --> 02:07:38,580
So always think more about others.

2121
02:07:38,660 --> 02:07:42,580
But of course, not at the cost of your own well-being.

2122
02:07:42,660 --> 02:07:48,580
But it provides a lot of meaning when you do something nice for someone.

2123
02:07:48,660 --> 02:07:50,660
It was a good day.

2124
02:07:50,970 --> 02:07:52,131
People remember you.

2125
