A French guy, French Canadian.

2136
02:08:21,410 --> 02:08:25,930
Yeah, a French Canadian. No, sorry, a French guy who was studying in Canada.

2137
02:08:26,010 --> 02:08:31,924
So when he went there to study, so we were talking about the nature of, you know,

2138
02:08:32,004 --> 02:08:35,473
how much Pakistanis like to give back to society, etc.

2139
02:08:35,553 --> 02:08:35,853
etc.

2140
02:08:35,933 --> 02:08:45,810
So he shared his own story that he was out of town or somewhere outside.

2141
02:08:46,320 --> 02:08:47,880
Toronto or somewhere else.

2142
02:08:47,960 --> 02:08:53,680
Sir, a Pakistani cab driver refused to take any money and helped him a lot while he was there.

