So yes, he was a student at that time and now he is a professor.

2145
02:08:59,040 --> 02:09:02,280
It must have been 20-25 years but he still remembers that.

2146
02:09:02,360 --> 02:09:06,360
So when you do a nice thing, people remember you.

2147
