So please be courteous towards others and I'm glad you shared this email. Thank you. Khush Rahi.

2150
02:09:24,060 --> 02:09:29,500
Is it patience or am I settling for less than I deserve? Please address this.

2151
02:09:29,580 --> 02:09:32,680
Hello, Junaid Bhai. I am ABC. If you find the time to.

2152
02:09:32,760 --> 02:09:37,960
time to read this. I'll be truly grateful. I deeply respect your no-nonsense take on life

2153
02:09:38,040 --> 02:09:42,680
and relationships, which is why I am writing to you. Apologies in advance for the long email.

2154
02:09:43,019 --> 02:09:47,920
but I need to lay out the full context so you can offer an honest and unbiased perspective.

2155
02:09:48,000 --> 02:09:51,440
Please keep professions and location details private.

2156
02:09:51,520 --> 02:09:53,826
This email is about two things.

2157
02:09:53,906 --> 02:09:56,898
Number one, issues with my fiancé's family.

2158
02:09:56,978 --> 02:09:59,560
Number two, our deteriorating relationship.

2159
02:09:59,640 --> 02:10:04,080
I had lived all my life outside Pakistan before moving to Pakistan seven years ago.

2160
02:10:10,400 --> 02:10:13,468
well-off household with little exposure to men.

2161
02:10:13,548 --> 02:10:17,740
My father enforced many rules but rarely followed them himself.

2162
02:10:17,820 --> 02:10:22,208
Witnessing dysfunctional marriages around me left lasting anxiety.

2163
02:10:22,288 --> 02:10:24,573
I'm turning thirty in a few months.

2164
02:10:24,653 --> 02:10:27,910
I met a guy nine years ago at a university.

2165
02:10:27,990 --> 02:10:31,653
He's from a Pashtun family and I am from Punjab.

2166
02:10:31,733 --> 02:10:32,763
He's also thirty.

2167
02:10:32,843 --> 02:10:35,540
We became friends, fell in love and have been

2168
02:10:35,620 --> 02:10:41,540
have been together for seven and a half years. From the beginning he was clear he wanted to marry me.

2169
02:10:41,620 --> 02:10:47,140
I was hesitant due to our vastly different cultures, backgrounds and financial situations.

2170
02:10:47,220 --> 02:10:52,340
He comes from a village. I have always lived in cities. He is an architect and I am a fashion designer.

2171
02:10:52,420 --> 02:10:56,140
Despite his conservative background, he has always been emotionally available.

2172
02:10:56,220 --> 02:11:02,220
Non-controlling never doubted me and has been respectful of my independence. That stood out to me.

2173
02:11:02,530 --> 02:11:06,974
My family had their reservations due to cultural and financial differences,

2174
02:11:07,054 --> 02:11:11,906
but his consistent support, especially when we were away from home in hostel life,

2175
02:11:11,986 --> 02:11:13,790
made me believe he was the one.

2176
02:11:13,890 --> 02:11:18,770
We got engaged two and a half years ago, but financial hurdles delayed our marriage.

2177
02:11:18,850 --> 02:11:20,453
A little about his family.

2178
02:11:20,533 --> 02:11:23,415
They live in a joint household in KPK.

2179
02:11:23,495 --> 02:11:24,710
He is the eldest son.

2180
02:11:24,790 --> 02:11:30,050
His father has worked abroad most of his life and visits every couple of years.

2181
02:11:30,190 --> 02:11:32,310
Three of his four sisters are married.

2182
02:11:32,390 --> 02:11:37,230
I accepted the cultural differences, financial challenges, and supported him emotionally throughout.

2183
02:11:37,310 --> 02:11:43,830
I even offered to keep the wedding small and share expenses since I work as well, but he said that wasn't practical.

2184
02:11:43,910 --> 02:11:48,470
He moved to the Middle East last year to save for our wedding.

2185
02:11:48,550 --> 02:11:52,670
After a year, I found out accidentally via his father.

2186
02:11:52,750 --> 02:11:56,790
The father doesn't know about it in detail either.

2187
02:11:57,360 --> 02:12:03,760
that the fiancé gave all his savings to fund his brother's university admission without telling me.

2188
02:12:03,840 --> 02:12:07,189
I wasn't as hurt by what he did, but how he did it.

2189
02:12:07,269 --> 02:12:09,036
No discussion, no transparency.

2190
02:12:09,116 --> 02:12:13,092
After all, our years of waiting, it delayed the wedding again,

2191
02:12:13,172 --> 02:12:16,640
and he doesn't seem to understand how deeply that hurt me.

2192
02:12:16,720 --> 02:12:21,760
He fails to see that he's not just sacrificing his happiness, but mine too.

2193
02:12:21,840 --> 02:12:25,060
At first, he called it a mistake and said he needed my moral support.

2194
02:12:25,140 --> 02:12:28,580
But later when I tried to talk about the impact, he shut down.

2195
02:12:28,660 --> 02:12:32,220
He still doesn't fully acknowledge the damage he caused.

2196
02:12:32,300 --> 02:12:37,420
When I asked when I'll move to the Middle East post marriage, he says, Jab job achi ho jayegi.

2197
02:12:37,500 --> 02:12:40,700
Which I understand, I can't live in his village.

2198
02:12:40,780 --> 02:12:43,460
And both families had agreed to that from the start.

2199
02:12:43,540 --> 02:12:47,580
Now they expect me to stay with them until he can afford to take me with him.

2200
02:12:47,660 --> 02:12:51,720
On honeymoon, shaadi ho le pehle, paise nahi hai.

2201
02:12:51,800 --> 02:12:54,411
His family always used a shared washroom.

2202
02:12:54,491 --> 02:12:58,707
When I said I need a private one, suddenly everyone needed one.

2203
02:12:58,787 --> 02:13:03,702
Construction began, not one or two, but four washrooms simultaneously.

2204
02:13:03,782 --> 02:13:08,580
And suddenly there's no budget of tiles fixation for ours.

2205
02:13:08,660 --> 02:13:11,023
Again, I only found out from others.

2206
02:13:11,103 --> 02:13:15,384
I've never been materialistic, never demanded gifts or luxuries.

2207
02:13:15,464 --> 02:13:18,050
I just want to feel like a priority now.

2208
02:13:18,130 --> 02:13:21,232
after years of patience and I am tired of waiting.

2209
02:13:21,312 --> 02:13:24,166
His family often makes snide remarks about me.

2210
02:13:24,246 --> 02:13:25,425
When I bring it up,

2211
02:13:25,505 --> 02:13:31,727
he downplays them as cultural differences and asks me not to make life difficult over small things.

2212
02:13:31,807 --> 02:13:36,292
Instead of protecting me, he avoids confrontation, fearing they'll say,

2213
02:13:36,372 --> 02:13:39,164
bivi aayi bhi nahi aur iski side le raha hai.

2214
02:13:39,244 --> 02:13:43,375
He admits they're wrong or wants to correct them only if pushed.

2215
02:13:43,455 --> 02:13:45,440
I worry I'll be expected to live

2216
02:13:45,840 --> 02:13:47,148
with them indefinitely.

2217
02:13:47,228 --> 02:13:52,680
His community fuels this with comments like, she's Punjabi, she won't stay with you guys.

2218
02:13:52,760 --> 02:13:56,000
These remarks reach him and he tells me, which is how I know.

2219
02:13:56,080 --> 02:14:00,887
Even the smallest things about my family and me, like not answering a call,

2220
02:14:00,967 --> 02:14:04,640
