2221
02:14:04,840 --> 02:14:09,680
I fear if not today, then maybe these later these things will impact our bond.

2222
02:14:09,760 --> 02:14:11,710
On the flip side, he shares his job.

2223
02:14:11,790 --> 02:14:14,214
