2224
02:14:14,294 --> 02:14:18,868
He's hidden his exact income from his family since he started earning.

2225
02:14:18,948 --> 02:14:19,510
His words.

2226
02:14:19,590 --> 02:14:24,146
In the beginning he used to call, apologize and express love, show care,

2227
02:14:24,226 --> 02:14:26,670
even if not express excessively.

2228
02:14:26,750 --> 02:14:29,944
Over time, three, four years into the relationship,

2229
02:14:30,024 --> 02:14:33,843
especially after the long distance started, that faded.

2230
02:14:33,923 --> 02:14:38,460
In the last year of long distance, he has hardly initiated fifteen calls.

2231
02:14:39,380 --> 02:14:42,264
Even before that, he mostly stopped calling.

2232
02:14:42,344 --> 02:14:46,500
Conversations became limited to texting or when we met.

2233
02:14:46,580 --> 02:14:49,300
I've raised this many times, but his replies are,

2234
02:14:49,380 --> 02:14:52,700
I don't call at my home either, he does it for me.

2235
02:14:52,780 --> 02:14:55,300
You do it when you want to talk.

2236
02:14:55,380 --> 02:14:59,100
And more recently, I don't have the personality to call.

2237
02:14:59,180 --> 02:15:00,900
If I didn't get a call, I didn't get a call.

2238
02:15:00,980 --> 02:15:05,780
But it was part of his personality before. Even brief five minute calls.

2239
02:15:06,070 --> 02:15:06,884
So what changed?

2240
02:15:06,964 --> 02:15:15,367
I also feel disrespected through his comments or jokes sometimes and when I bring it up instead of truly understanding the impact they have on me,

2241
02:15:15,447 --> 02:15:17,673
he becomes defensive or shuts down.

2242
02:15:17,753 --> 02:15:22,114
Silent treatments after arguments have lasted for days, even three weeks once,

2243
02:15:22,194 --> 02:15:31,026
during which he didn't even wish me on Eid and he holds back affection after resolving the agreement the argument for weeks or months,

2244
02:15:31,106 --> 02:15:33,110
which in return causes more fights and

2245
02:15:33,190 --> 02:15:36,462
And it's a cycle he had become a and had become a pattern.

2246
02:15:36,542 --> 02:15:39,717
The pattern existed even when he was in Pakistan,

2247
02:15:39,797 --> 02:15:42,473
