Recently I told him clearly I feel emotionally abused.

2249
02:15:45,679 --> 02:15:48,895
He said he'll fix things and bring back the love we lost.

2250
02:15:48,975 --> 02:15:50,499
But I've heard that before.

2251
02:15:50,579 --> 02:15:52,328
Change has never lasted so far.

2252
