Says his love for me is still the same even more than before.

2254
02:15:57,557 --> 02:15:58,960
And he's been waiting long.

2255
02:15:59,040 --> 02:16:00,956
longer than I have to be together.

2256
02:16:01,036 --> 02:16:08,122
Also says we'll do we'll always do what's best for our relationship and your happiness.

2257
02:16:08,202 --> 02:16:12,018
To be fair he does try his best to fix other problems in my life.

2258
02:16:12,098 --> 02:16:15,758
He just doesn't know how to handle the one problem that's us.

2259
02:16:15,838 --> 02:16:22,898
I didn't care about any other aspect all I wanted was the emotional connection and now even that feels lost.

2260
02:16:22,978 --> 02:16:24,640
I've also nagged at times and

2261
02:16:24,720 --> 02:16:26,980
and repeated issues till I felt hurt.

2262
02:16:27,060 --> 02:16:28,756
I own that.

2263
02:16:28,836 --> 02:16:33,199
I've had panic attacks after arguments with him, not just due to him,

2264
02:16:33,279 --> 02:16:37,114
