2265
02:16:37,194 --> 02:16:41,512
I don't know if it's the distance, the pressure of the Middle East,

2266
02:16:41,592 --> 02:16:46,115
or making money for the wedding exhaustion or lack of interest in me.

2267
02:16:46,195 --> 02:16:51,019
He lives in one of those rooms you once described, shared space, bunk beds,

2268
02:16:51,099 --> 02:16:52,170
no attached baths, was

2269
