Working hard for his family. It's his first time away from home.

2270
02:16:55,890 --> 02:16:59,090
Maybe it's all just taking a toll. But what do I know?

2271
02:16:59,170 --> 02:17:03,490
But what I do know is this doesn't feel healthy.

2272
02:17:03,570 --> 02:17:07,730
We're walking on eggshells and even small conversations turn into arguments.

2273
02:17:07,810 --> 02:17:13,530
I've left no stone unturned. I've communicated, argued, taken therapy, even dragged him to couples therapy.

2274
02:17:13,610 --> 02:17:15,130
He refused to go. He says,

2275
02:17:15,210 --> 02:17:18,850
Who can make me understand better than myself?

2276
02:17:19,230 --> 02:17:21,830
Keep me away from all this. If you want to go, you go.

2277
02:17:29,470 --> 02:17:31,988
who sees through the bullshit and says it like it is.

2278
02:17:32,068 --> 02:17:35,333
His family is currently asking for a wedding date and I'm frozen,

2279
02:17:35,413 --> 02:17:38,310
