2280
02:17:38,390 --> 02:17:40,710
Whether or not have I made this the right choice.

2281
02:17:40,790 --> 02:17:45,780
Even when elders prayed for him, it was always, Allah tumhe kamyaab karein.

2282
02:17:45,860 --> 02:17:46,160
so that you can support your parents.

2283
02:17:46,240 --> 02:17:48,460
so that you can become a support for your parents.

2284
02:17:48,540 --> 02:17:51,180
Never once for him directly, his words.

2285
02:17:51,260 --> 02:17:54,060
My family says, whatever it is, you know it.

2286
02:17:54,140 --> 02:17:55,580
I don't know what the next one will be.

2287
02:17:55,660 --> 02:17:58,820
Not everyone is perfect. There are problems in this. What will happen in the next one?

2288
02:17:58,900 --> 02:18:00,180
What will not happen in the next one?

2289
02:18:00,260 --> 02:18:05,460
And they're not wrong. I'm almost thirty, anxious, emotionally tired, and my biological clock is ticking.

2290
02:18:05,540 --> 02:18:10,100
I could have chosen a richer guy, but I believe risk is from Allah.

2291
