2968
03:03:16,722 --> 03:03:21,833
Suddenly this guy behind me wearing loud Versace knockoff sunglasses at night goes,

2969
03:03:21,913 --> 03:03:29,172
leave auntie my wife has dramas to watch and also needs emotional support she watched Bano on PTV and cried for three days.

2970
03:03:29,252 --> 03:03:31,853
Give her a wheelchair too.

2971
03:03:31,933 --> 03:03:33,140
